Hello again,

Jošt has taken the discussion precisely in the desired direction. Since your variables per factor seem to not correlate very much (or at all), this alone should be sufficient justification as to why the final model does not fit/does not converge. Factor loads should always be inspected.

Good luck.
Marcus

