Roger,

This looks like your variable names are incorrect in the model. I generally recommend not using spaces in variable names. Lavaan does not seem to be able to handle variablenames with spaces (https://github.com/yrosseel/lavaan/issues/332)

If you are new to R, I recommend https://r4ds.hadley.nz. Once you get to variable renaming, apply that to remove spaces from the variable names and try estimating the model again.

Mikko

